rl":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"91c207afa70b0eb008d3149061a1db6313727dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/commits/91c207afa70b0eb008d3149061a1db6313727dd4","html_url":"https://github.com/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/commit/91c207afa70b0eb008d3149061a1db6313727dd4"},{"sha":"e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/commits/e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b","html_url":"https://github.com/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/commit/e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b"}]},{"sha":"e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b","node_id":"C_kwDOQSapJtoAKGU2ZDk2MzZhYWM1MGMzYjIxMjM3ZWZiZTNhYWE1OTdmYTQ4ZjEzNGI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2025-11-10T18:48:30Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2025-11-10T18:48:30Z"},"message":"Refactor scraper into Vercel-friendly serverless API with Supabase\n\nConverts the single-file SQLite scraper into a modular, serverless Python API that:\n- Deploys on Vercel with FastAPI\n- Stores data in Supabase instead of local SQLite\n- Uses service role for secure server-side writes\n- Implements idempotent upserts on date field\n- Includes comprehensive pytest unit tests with mocked dependencies\n- Provides optional cron scheduling for daily runs at 11:00 UTC\n- Preserves original parsing logic for TSA passenger volumes\n\nProject structure:\n- api/index.py: FastAPI entry point for Vercel\n- app/: Core logic (scraper, dal, models, settings, utils)\n- tests/: Unit tests with network and DB mocking\n- vercel.json: Deployment config with cron schedule\n- requirements.txt: Python dependencies\n\nEndpoints:\n- GET /api/healthz: Health check\n- GET /api/run: Trigger scraper and upsert to Supabase\n\nSetup requires:\n- Supabase table creation (SQL provided in README)\n- Environment variables: SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY","tree":{"sha":"df0377bc7176052bbb0845e05d643f62bb42cd7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/git/trees/df0377bc7176052bbb0845e05d643f62bb42cd7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/git/commits/e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMIr2U25\n+E+eMmBeBIVmLRidMp9sOYgaseeQthkD3Aluyi13p0Kttx1G6RYbioIhKT7S2Mq21XX5kRLS+09Q\nrQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree df0377bc7176052bbb0845e05d643f62bb42cd7d\nparent 91c207afa70b0eb008d3149061a1db6313727dd4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762800510 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762800510 +0000\n\nRefactor scraper into Vercel-friendly serverless API with Supabase\n\nConverts the single-file SQLite scraper into a modular, serverless Python API that:\n- Deploys on Vercel with FastAPI\n- Stores data in Supabase instead of local SQLite\n- Uses service role for secure server-side writes\n- Implements idempotent upserts on date field\n- Includes comprehensive pytest unit tests with mocked dependencies\n- Provides optional cron scheduling for daily runs at 11:00 UTC\n- Preserves original parsing logic for TSA passenger volumes\n\nProject structure:\n- api/index.py: FastAPI entry point for Vercel\n- app/: Core logic (scraper, dal, models, settings, utils)\n- tests/: Unit tests with network and DB mocking\n- vercel.json: Deployment config with cron schedule\n- requirements.txt: Python dependencies\n\nEndpoints:\n- GET /api/healthz: Health check\n- GET /api/run: Trigger scraper and upsert to Supabase\n\nSetup requires:\n- Supabase table creation (SQL provided in README)\n- Environment variables: SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY\n","verified_at":"2025-11-10T18:48:40Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/commits/e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b","html_url":"https://github.com/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/commit/e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zach-wendland/TSA-volume/commits/e6d9636aac50c3b21237efbe3aaa597fa48f134b/comments","author":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/o